           nobody ever sees. Left unset, the install defaults the name to the
           hostname; the admin page can still set a friendly name later.
           Everything on this row is TOP aligned and shares one height. -->
      <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="Page to show" Foreground="#E6EDF3" FontFamily="Segoe UI"
